catflow 0.8
1. Read Files   memos/; pattern=*.m4a
2. <each transcribe_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read Audio   (input:1)
     2. Transcribe               Whisper Tiny; lang=en
     3. Gate                     Ministral 3B; "Garbled or truncated? tags:
                                 bad, ok"
        -> { bad: 4 | ok: 5 }
     4. Transcribe   (1)         Whisper Large v3; lang=en
     5. Template                 "{1}"
3. Join Text    separator="\n\n---\n\n"
4. Save Text    transcripts.md
